OL,3,GNEWSACommunity 'sad and wounded' by
OL,4,AAncient Market fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis stall is among those damaged, and
OL,7,Fhe fears #2,000 worth of fish stored in
OL,8,Fthe outdoor fridges has been destroyed.
